372..449 Comment "/// The sum of two integers with the first as an accumulator: each step moves"
450..528 Comment "/// one successor or predecessor of `b` onto `acc`. It respects `Int`\'s rules:"
529..608 Comment "/// at `S(P(x))` it computes `count(P(S(acc)), x)`, which the second rule reads"
609..632 Comment "/// as `count(acc, x)`."
